Analyze {{ ticker }} stock investment opportunity.

MARKET DATA:
- Current Price: ${{ "%.2f"|format(current_price) }}
- P/E Ratio: {{ pe_ratio if pe_ratio else 'N/A' }}
- Beta: {{ beta if beta else 'N/A' }}
- Market Cap: ${{ "{:,.0f}".format(market_cap) }}

DCF ANALYSIS:
- Intrinsic Value: ${{ "%.2f"|format(intrinsic_value) }}
